  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Ocean Viking</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HSP@SEA: Belgian Red Cross Support in Search and Rescue Operations
The HSP@SEA initiative began in July 2021 as an Emergency Appeal and has been part of the Europe Region Operational Plan since January 2022.
This operation leverages the strengths of both organizations:
&#x2022; SOS MEDITERRANEE focuses on search and rescue (SAR) operations.
&#x2022; The IFRC provides support to survivors, including food, water, medical care, and psychosocial assistance.
Belgian Red Cross Involvement Since 2021, the Belgian Red Cross has actively supported this operation:
&#x2022; Delegates sent: 4 delegates across 3 roles (Protection Delegate, Protection Team Leader &amp; Operations Manager).
&#x2022; Rotations participated in: 8 different rotations.
Belgium RC during 2025 will continue supporting the Protection sector by deploying delegates for the two required profiles on the Ocean Viking:
&#x2022; Protection Delegate
&#x2022; Protection Team Leader</narrative>
  </description>
